## Summary

Both issues in Clicky Chat are fixed. ✓ `npm run build` and `npm run typecheck:functions` pass.

**Issue #1 (HIGH):** Preset option buttons now stay enabled when hitting 429 limit or daily cap. Added `setTextInputEnabled()` method to disable only text input + Ask button. In all error branches (limit, daily, off_topic, blocked, empty, error, timeout), options are re-shown and remain tappable. Users can still tap preset questions even after hitting limits.

**Issue #2 (MEDIUM):** Fixed 1280×720 layout clipping for 3-line bubbles by reducing vertical footprint: bubble min-height 4.5em→3.8em, padding 14px 18px→12px 16px; option button padding 8px 14px→6px 12px (min-height stays ≥36px); hint text line-height 1.1→1 and shortened to "Or ask a question...". Input row no longer clips under "Requiescat in pace" button.
